    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 181 An Fiodán is a spacious 4 bedroom semi detached home perfectly located at the front of the well-maintained development.\n\nThis is a very attractive home that offers bright and spacious accommodation throughout. It will appeal to both first-time buyers and investors alike.\n\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a spacious living room with a large window overlooking communal green, fully equipped kitchen/dining room with direct access onto the garden, and a convenient guest WC. The first floor includes four bedrooms, with one en suite, a hotpress, and a family bathroom. The property also benefits from off-street parking to the front with gated side access.\n\nAn Fiodán is a highly sought-after location, with an array of amenities within walking distance. These include primary and secondary schools, Lidl, Briarhill Shopping Centre, playgrounds, and a soccer pitch. Additionally, Galway City Centre is just 6km away, and the property is close to both Parkmore and Ballybane Industrial Estates, as well as the M6 Motorway, ensuring excellent transport links.\n\nWe highly recommend arranging a viewing to appreciate all that this property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nCarpet floor, side aspect window, carpet stairs to first floor, understairs storage, coving.\n\nLiving Room: - \nSpacious room to the front with laminate wooden floor, large front aspect window overlooking communal green, coving, wooden fireplace with gas fire inset, double doors to kitchen/dining room.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room: - \nLaminate wooden floor, fitted kitchen units with ample storage, plumbed for washing machine and tumble dryer, electric cooker and hob, rear aspect window, french doors lead to south facing rear garden.\n\nWC: - \nTiled floor, wc, wash hand basin, side aspect window.\n\nLanding: - \nCarpet landing, side aspect window, access to attic, shelved hotpress.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nSpacious room to the front of the house with carpet floor, fitted wardrobes, front aspect window.\n\nEn-Suite: - \nTiled floor, wc, wash hand basin, shower unit.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nCarpet floor, front aspect window, fitted wardrobes.\n\nBathroom: - \nTiled floor, wc, wash hand basin, bath, extractor fan.\n\nBedroom 3: - \nCarpet floor, rear aspect window, fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 4: - \nCarpet floor, rear aspect window.\n\nGarden: - \nSouth facing rear garden, laid in lawn with block wall boundary. Gated side access. Off street parking to the front.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Gas fired central heating</li><li>Off street parking to the front</li><li>Excellent location</li><li>Overlooking communal green area</li><li>Management Fee 300 per annum approx</ul>"
      },
